#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:0
msgid ""
"Configure how Orca presents spell checker information, such as spelling "
"misspelled words and suggestions and speaking error context."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:7
msgid "Spellcheck preferences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:9
msgid ""
"Orca tries to provide a consistent user experience when interacting with "
"application spell checkers. For applications where this enhanced support has "
"been provided, you will find several options which you can adjust to get the "
"verbosity level that works best for you. You can have both brief and verbose "
"spell check information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:12
msgid ""
"If you normally want very little verbosity when using a spell checker, but "
"occasionally need detailed information about a given error, you can disable "
"these options. When you need additional details, just use Orca's detailed "
"Where Am I command to have Orca present the current error as if all of these "
"options were enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:14
msgid "Spell error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:16
msgid "If checked, Orca spells out the misspelled word after speaking it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:18
#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:24
#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:30
msgid "**Default value:** Checked"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:20
msgid "Spell suggestion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:22
msgid "If checked, Orca spells out the suggested correction after speaking it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:26
msgid "Present context of error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-spellcheck.md:28
msgid ""
"If checked, Orca speaks the sentence or line from the document in which the "
"error is found."
msgstr ""
